        "original_id": "639549bd-bf47-5d89-83c4-6403c5ebb137",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jaroslav Kvapil\n- Places: Chudenice, Prague, Kingdom of Bohemia, Central Europe\n- Roles: poet, playwright, librettist\n- Concepts: medieval and early modern monarchy, predecessor state\n\nFacts:\n- Jaroslav Kvapil was born on 25 September 1868 in Chudenice in the Kingdom of Bohemia.\n- The Kingdom of Bohemia was a medieval and early modern monarchy in Central Europe.\n- The Kingdom of Bohemia was the predecessor of the modern Czech Republic.\n- Jaroslav Kvapil was a Czech poet, playwright, and librettist.\n- Jaroslav Kvapil died on 10 January 1950 in Prague.",
